### Register 

POST {{URL}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "name",
    "lastName": "lastname",
    "email": "email2@test.com",
    "password": "12345678"
}


### Login 

POST {{URL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "email@test.com",
    "password": "12345678"
}


### Logout 

POST {{URL}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Get All categories
GET {{URL}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Get Single category
GET {{URL}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### create  category
POST {{URL}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"delete category",
    "categoryType":"INCOME",
    "color":"#4c1c74"
}

### update  category
PATCH {{URL}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"My first category edit",
    "categoryType":"INCOME",
    "color":"#4c1c74"
}

### delete  category
DELETE {{URL}}/categories/3
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}



### Get All accounts
GET {{URL}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Get Single account
GET {{URL}}/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}


### CREAR ACCOUNT
POST {{URL}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"delete account",
    "accountType":"BANK",
    "color":"#99ec14",
    "currency":"MXN",
    "balance":1000.55
}

### update ACCOUNT
PATCH {{URL}}/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"My first Account",
    "accountType":"BANK",
    "color":"#4c1c74",
    "currency":"MXN",
    "balance":1000.55
}

### delete  account
DELETE {{URL}}/accounts/2
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}